      "id": "MLP-4610",
      "en": "My arm has been swollen for a while, and I've heard this might be lymphedema. What exactly causes the fluid to build up in my tissues?",
      "zh": "我的手臂肿了一段时间，听说这可能是淋巴水肿。到底是什么原因导致液体在我的组织里积聚的？",
