      "id": "MLP-128",
      "en": "I was told I might have an adrenal gland disorder because my hormone levels are off. What exactly happens in the body when someone has this condition?",
      "zh": "医生告诉我我可能有肾上腺疾病，因为我的激素水平不正常。当一个人患有这种病时，身体里具体会发生什么？",
      "evidence_id": "S006"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-5656",
      "en": "My partner and I have been trying to have a baby for over a year without success. What are some common physical reasons a man might have trouble getting a woman pregnant?",
      "zh": "我和伴侣尝试怀孕一年多都没有成功。男性导致女性难以怀孕的常见身体原因有哪些？",
      "evidence_id": "S001"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-518",
      "en": "I recently lost my leg due to a severe injury. I've heard some people feel pain in the limb that is no longer there. What is this feeling called?",
      "zh": "我最近因为严重受伤失去了腿。听说有些人会在已经不存在的肢体上感到疼痛，这种感觉叫什么？",
      "evidence_id": "S005"
    },
    {
      "id": "MLP-1104",
      "en": "My doctor ordered a scan to check my internal organs. What is the general purpose of these imaging tests that create pictures of the inside of the body?",
      "zh": "我的医生开了一项扫描检查我的内脏。这些能生成体内图像的成像检查的一般目的是什么？",
      "evidence_id": "S002"
    }
  ]
